        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Grid -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
        <div class="bg-background p-6 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">What is Grokipedia?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Grokipedia</strong> is an AI-powered online encyclopedia created by Elon Musk's xAI company. Unlike traditional encyclopedias like Wikipedia that rely on human editors, Grokipedia uses advanced artificial intelligence (Grok AI) to automatically generate and maintain encyclopedia articles. Launched in October 2025, it currently contains over 885,000 AI-generated articles across various topics.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
        <div class="bg-background p-6 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">How does Grokipedia differ from Wikipedia?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            The main difference is that <strong>Grokipedia vs Wikipedia</strong> represents AI vs. human curation. Grokipedia uses AI to generate all content without user editing, while Wikipedia relies on millions of volunteer editors. Grokipedia offers faster content creation and real-time updates, but Wikipedia provides transparent editing history and community oversight. Learn more in our detailed <a href="/grokipedia/comparison-guide/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Grokipedia vs Wikipedia comparison guide</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
        <div class="bg-background p-6 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">Is there a Grokipedia app?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Currently, the <strong>Grokipedia app</strong> is available as a mobile-responsive web app and Progressive Web App (PWA). Native iOS and Android apps are in development. You can access Grokipedia on any smartphone or tablet through your mobile browser. Visit our <a href="/grokipedia/mobile-access/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Grokipedia app guide</a> for installation instructions and mobile features.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
        <div class="bg-background p-6 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">What is the official Grokipedia website link?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            The official <strong>Grokipedia link</strong> and website can be accessed at <a href="https://grokipedia.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">grokipedia.com</a>. You can also access it through xAI's ecosystem. For more information about features, community resources, GitHub projects, and Reddit discussions, check our comprehensive <a href="/grokipedia/official-website/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Grokipedia official website guide</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
        <div class="bg-background p-6 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">Is Grokipedia accurate and reliable?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Grokipedia's accuracy has been questioned by experts, including Wikipedia founder Jimmy Wales who warned about "massive errors." As an AI-generated platform, Grokipedia can suffer from AI hallucinations, bias, and lack of transparency. While it offers comprehensive coverage, users should verify critical information from multiple sources. Read our <a href="/analysis/bias-accuracy/" class="text-primary hover:underline">detailed accuracy analysis</a> for more insights.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
        <div class="bg-background p-6 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">Can I find Grokipedia on GitHub or Reddit?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            While Grokipedia itself isn't open-source, you can find <strong>Grokipedia GitHub</strong> community projects including analysis tools, API wrappers, and browser extensions. <strong>Grokipedia Reddit</strong> discussions are active on subreddits like r/Grokipedia, r/ArtificialIntelligence, and r/Wikipedia. These communities debate accuracy, share experiences, and discuss the platform's future. Visit our <a href="/grokipedia/official-website/#community-resources--grokipedia-links" class="text-primary hover:underline">community resources section</a> for links.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a href="/grokipedia/" class="btn btn-primary px-8 py-3">
          Explore All Grokipedia Topics
